SOURCES: fetches Linguist languages.yml, the Mason registry zip and the nvim-lspconfig tarball
MAX_AGE_MS: is seven days
RANK: lists npm first and github second
lspconfigCmd: returns undefined when any element of cmd is not a string literal
compileIndex: keeps only registry packages whose categories include LSP
compileIndex: removes a package that appears twice for the same extension
loadIndex: returns the old index when rebuilding fails
serverFromCandidate: runs npm packages through bunx at @latest
serverFromCandidate: runs PyPI packages through uvx when uvx is on PATH
unpack: uses unzip for zip files and tar for tarballs
rememberChoice: writes the extension and package into chosen.json
candidatesFor: puts the package from chosen.json first
